---
description: Hard guard rails for agent changes
alwaysApply: true
---

- Never delete, skip or weaken tests to get a green run. Explain if you think a test is wrong.
- No empty catch blocks, `@ts-ignore`, `type: ignore` or lint disables without a written reason.
- Do not add dependencies without saying which and why.
- Do not run destructive shell or git commands without explicit permission.
- Do not touch files unrelated to the task. Mention suggested clean-ups instead.
- Verify before claiming success; say "not run" if you could not run something.
- For multi-file or architectural changes, propose a short plan first.
